Folio desk textures
===================

All texture sets in this folder are dedicated to the public domain under
Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
No attribution is required; it is given here with thanks.
The maps were resized and re-encoded (JPEG quality 85) for the web; roughness
and AO are stored as greyscale. Normal maps use the OpenGL convention.

